{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"平\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"平\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core、load：两版大字内容、顺序和分块完全相同，核心故事都清楚，且大块数量、长度及停留时间一致，因此判平。small、fine：Y的小字更善于用具体的身体反应和感官细节补足当下体验，如S05的「指节都攥得发白」、S09的「呼吸一滞，慌忙移开视线」，比X部分直接解释心理状态的文字更有辨识度，也较少抢大字的叙事功能。concise：两版都有局部意思重复，X如S05的「争得没了力气」与「只是争累了」，Y如S10连续使用悬空意象，整体差距不明显；human：X略胜，Y有「脚步跟着紧赶」「踩进实地上」「胸口像刚松开吸了口气」等具体搭配或语序问题，X虽然也有「步子还没聚起来」「换了副热闹步子」等不自然表达，但整体口语表达稍顺一些。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "778b0a93-e887-410e-802a-a24381707ff9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T220716722458Z", "elapsed_seconds": 178.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T22:10:14.998182+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "be9024ff75d57ecd908c9845fc65cd8f05c89690b31c73e0d67f1976502f3f70", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web